# Title: Uncommon Service Installation Image Path
# ID: 26481afe-db26-4228-b264-25a29fe6efc7
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-03-18
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, car.2013-09-005, attack.t1543.003
# Description: Detects uncommon service installation commands by looking at suspicious or uncommon image path values containing references to encoded powershell commands, temporary paths, etc.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((Provider_Name:"Service Control Manager" AND EventID:"7045") AND (((ImagePath:*\\\\\\\\.\\\\pipe* OR ImagePath:*\\Users\\Public\\* OR ImagePath:*\\Windows\\Temp\\*)) OR ((ImagePath:* -e*) AND ((ImagePath:* aQBlAHgA* OR ImagePath:* aWV4I* OR ImagePath:* IAB* OR ImagePath:* JAB* OR ImagePath:* PAA* OR ImagePath:* SQBFAFgA* OR ImagePath:* SUVYI*)))) AND -((ImagePath:C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Definition Updates\\*)) AND -((ImagePath:C:\\WINDOWS\\TEMP\\thor10-remote\\thor64.exe*)))
